-- One canonical, clinically bounded answerable article for the real user query 'I have weak eyesight'.
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_articles(id,slug,title,arabic_title,subtitle,domain,entry_type,abstract,identity_text,alternate_names,editorial_note,review_status,status,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','Weak Eyesight and Prophetic Medicine','ضعف البصر والطب النبوي','How to understand blurred vision, the ithmid narration and safe eye care','prophetic_medicine','concept','Weak eyesight is a symptom, not a diagnosis. Islamic narrations mention ithmid collyrium and healing, but they do not establish a safe, clinically proven treatment for refractive error or other causes of blurred vision. An eye examination comes first; traditional kohl can be contaminated with toxic lead.','A symptom-led, medically bounded reference article.','i have weak eyesight,weak eyesight,poor eyesight,weak vision,blurry vision,blurred vision,eyesight,eye sight,eye problems,vision problem,difficulty seeing,short sight,short-sightedness,short sighted,near sighted,nearsighted,eyes weak,eye health,ithmid,surma,kohl,vision loss,poor vision,vision weakness','Source-linked editorial text; expert and scholarly review pending.','editorial_draft','published','52');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s1','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','What weak eyesight may mean','overview','Weak or blurred eyesight can reflect problems focusing light on the retina, including short-sightedness, long-sightedness, astigmatism or presbyopia. Other causes include cataracts, diabetes-related eye disease, retinal conditions and eye inflammation. Some changes are correctable with glasses or other treatment, while others need urgent care. This is why a symptom search cannot responsibly produce one universal remedy. WHO''s February 2026 explanation of refractive errors distinguishes the main forms of blurred vision and notes how common uncorrected conditions are.','1');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s2','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','What Islamic sources actually say','transmission','Sunan Abi Dawud 4061 combines encouragement of white garments with a narration about ithmid, a traditional eye collyrium, and a statement concerning vision. Its source context and hadith grading should be checked in the complete record; the narration does not identify the cause of a modern patient''s blurry eyesight. Sahih Muslim 2204 offers broader religious context concerning seeking remedies and healing by Allah''s permission. These reports must not be used to claim that every product marketed as ''Prophetic surma'' restores sight.','2');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s3','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','The modern evidence boundary','science','A historical report about ithmid is not the same as a modern clinical trial for myopia, cataract, glaucoma, diabetic retinopathy or age-related vision changes. No clinical effectiveness claim for a retail kohl product is approved by this entry. Many traditional products marketed as kohl, kajal or surma contain lead or other metals; the US Food and Drug Administration warns that these can cause lead poisoning. An untested product must not be placed in the eye because of a religious label.','3');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s4','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','What to do if your eyesight is weak','practice','Arrange an examination with an optometrist or ophthalmologist to establish whether the issue is a refractive error or an eye disease. Describe whether it affects one or both eyes, distant or near vision, and whether it developed suddenly or gradually. If you have diabetes, ask about a dilated eye examination and follow your care team''s schedule. Glasses, contact lenses or medical treatment depend on the diagnosis. Spiritual supplication may accompany evaluation and care but cannot replace either.','4');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s5','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','When changes are urgent','safety','Seek immediate emergency care for sudden loss of vision, sudden severe eye pain or acute serious symptoms. Prompt assessment is also important for new flashes, a curtain-like shadow, new floaters, eye pain or worsening blurred vision. Do not drive yourself if vision is suddenly impaired. Do not experiment with traditional collyrium, unidentified eye drops or supplements as a substitute for diagnosis.','5');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_sections(id,article_id,heading,section_type,body,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-s6','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','Source comparison and scholarly review','methodology','This article separates (1) the attributed words of an Islamic narration, (2) its scholarly explanation, (3) modern medical diagnosis and (4) product safety. These are not interchangeable sources of evidence. The entry is a sourced editorial answer, not an independently scholar- or clinician-approved treatment plan. Any addition of Quranic or Hadith Arabic or medical trial conclusions must undergo an independent qualified review.','6');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO encyclopedia_citations(id,article_id,citation_type,source_title,citation_ref,source_url,source_note,verification_status,sort_order) VALUES('weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine-r1','weak-eyesight-prophetic-medicine','clinical','World Health Organization — Refractive errors','11 February 2026 overview','https://www.who.int/news-room/questions-and-answers/item/blindness-and-vision-impairment-refractive-errors','Explains common correctable focusing problems.','pending','1');
